# The app needs NO credentials to run. Every data source it uses is public:
# NASA GLOBE, NIFC, the U.S. Drought Monitor, USDA Forest Service LCMS, the
# Hawaii Statewide GIS Program, the U.S. Census and AWS Terrain Tiles.
#
# Earth Engine scripts in scripts/gee/ run in the Earth Engine Code Editor under
# your own Google account — never put Earth Engine or Google credentials here, and
# never commit a service-account key.
#
# Reserved for future integrations (unused today):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
